  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kaduna Lepers (KALE) Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to build the organizational capacity of LAN Kaduna through training, allowing for future growth and expansion. The funds will also help the Association improve production capacity of soap and pomade through purchase of improved material inputs, equipment and production training.</narrative>
  </description>
